# Shell scripts run inside Alpine where a CRLF shebang is a fatal
# "no such file or directory: /bin/sh^M" error, and Docker `COPY` reads the
# working copy rather than the normalised blob. Force LF on disk regardless of
# the local core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.template  text eol=lf
